Package: deblite-installer
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: DebLite Project <deblite@example.invalid>
Installed-Size: 1
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1,
 gdisk, parted, cryptsetup, cryptsetup-initramfs, initramfs-tools, dosfstools,
 e2fsprogs, xfsprogs, btrfs-progs, rsync, squashfs-tools, util-linux, mount, sudo,
 adduser, locales, grub2-common, grub-efi-amd64-bin, grub-pc-bin, efibootmgr
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: DebLite system installer
 A small, UI-agnostic installer for DebLite. It partitions a disk,
 copies the live system's squashfs onto it, removes live-session
 packages, configures users, locale, services, LUKS and GRUB.
 .
 It provides a GTK4/libadwaita wizard, an interactive CLI and a
 headless JSON-driven mode used by the graphical frontend.
